---
// Why vehicle type changes the planner: quads turn in place, fixed-wing aircraft cannot.
---

<div class="uav" role="group" aria-label="Quadcopter path versus fixed-wing path around an obstacle">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 270 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="uav-q-t uav-q-d">
    <title id="uav-q-t">Quadcopter: grid A* plus smoothing</title>
    <desc id="uav-q-d">
      A quadcopter can stop and turn in place, so a grid A* path with a sharp corner, then smoothed, is flyable.
    </desc>
    <text class="h" x="0" y="18">QUADCOPTER</text>
    <rect class="obst" x="40" y="70" width="110" height="80" />
    <path class="grid-path" d="M20 200 L190 200 L190 40" />
    <circle class="corner" cx="190" cy="200" r="5" />
    <text class="note" x="150" y="222">turns in place</text>
    <circle class="end" cx="20" cy="200" r="4" />
    <text class="lbl" x="12" y="224">S</text>
    <circle class="end" cx="190" cy="40" r="4" />
    <text class="lbl" x="200" y="44">G</text>
    <text class="cap" x="0" y="246">Grid A* + smoothing</text>
  </svg>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 270 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="uav-f-t uav-f-d">
    <title id="uav-f-t">Fixed-wing: Hybrid A*</title>
    <desc id="uav-f-d">
      A fixed-wing aircraft has a minimum turn radius, so the planner must build the path from kinematically
      feasible arcs, which is what Hybrid A* does.
    </desc>
    <text class="h" x="0" y="18">FIXED-WING</text>
    <rect class="obst" x="40" y="70" width="110" height="80" />
    <path class="feasible" d="M20 200 L120 200 A70 70 0 0 0 190 130 L190 40" />
    <path class="radius" d="M120 130 L120 200" />
    <circle class="center" cx="120" cy="130" r="2.5" />
    <text class="note" x="128" y="172">R min</text>
    <circle class="end" cx="20" cy="200" r="4" />
    <text class="lbl" x="12" y="224">S</text>
    <circle class="end" cx="190" cy="40" r="4" />
    <text class="lbl" x="200" y="44">G</text>
    <text class="cap" x="0" y="246">Hybrid A*: feasible motion primitives</text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .uav {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem 2.5rem;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 22rem;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .h {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    fill: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .obst {
    fill: var(--paper-2);
    stroke: var(--ink-2);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .grid-path,
  .feasible {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linejoin: miter;
  }
  .grid-path {
    stroke: var(--copper);
  }
  .feasible {
    stroke: var(--signal);
  }
  .corner {
    fill: var(--paper);
    stroke: var(--copper);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .radius {
    stroke: var(--ink);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
  }
  .center,
  .end {
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .lbl {
    font-size: 12px;
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
  .cap {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    fill: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
